senses.gloss:
1 हि हिनो॑ति हिनुते हि॑न्वति (ह॑यति), pp. हित॑
impel, urge on, set in motion, hurl, send forth (M. intr. hasten,
speed);
 further, help to (dat.);
 get, procure. आ M. bring near. प्र
(हिणोति) urge on, impel, hurl, cast, turn upon (dat. or loc.);
 call
upon, summon;
 send out, dismiss, dispatch to (dat., gen. ±अन्तिकम् or
पार्श्वम्, acc. ±प्रति), in order to (dat. or infin.);
 bring near,
get, procure, furnish. अनुप्र send after. अभिप्र send hither.
उपप्र send to (acc.). प्रतिप्र send or drive back. सम् send out;
bring together, join, combine, compose.

2 हि॑ (indecl.) for, because, namely;
 surely, verily, indeed;
well, pray (with an imper., conj., or optat.).
